  <item>
    <title><![CDATA[Evolving a Flappy Bird AI: 100 Solutions Explored, 6.6x Improvement, $12]]></title>
    <link>https://www.weco.ai/blog/flappy-bird-case-study</link>
    <guid>https://www.weco.ai/blog/flappy-bird-case-study</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Feb 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[We gave Weco a simple Flappy Bird AI that scored 2.76 points on average. 100 iterations and $12 later, the AI scored 20.9 - a 6.6x improvement.]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://www.weco.ai/assets/blogs/flappy-bird-case-study/cover.png" type="image/jpeg" />
    <author>Weco Team</author>
  </item>
  
